{"seq":2,"slug":"guideline-iteration-adjudication","title":"标注规范迭代、培训与仲裁流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/corpus-linguistics-language-resource-engineering/annotation-schema-agreement/guideline-iteration-adjudication","wordCount":2595,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"标注规范迭代-培训与仲裁流程\">标注规范迭代、培训与仲裁流程</h1><p>标签集设计得再干净，落到几十个标注者、几百万 token 上时，真正决定语料质量的是一套<strong>流程</strong>：规范怎么写、什么时候冻结、人怎么训、分歧怎么裁决。Universal Dependencies 的 guideline 专门维护一份「Change history」表逐条记录规范改动（<a href=\"https://universaldependencies.org/guidelines.html\">universaldependencies.org/guidelines.html</a>），恰因为这层流程比标签本身更容易被忽视——它是把「设计」变成「可复现数据」的工程环节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-规范是可执行的判定程序\">核心概念：规范是可执行的判定程序</h2><p>标注手册（annotation guideline）不是术语表，而是一份<strong>判定程序</strong>。一条合格的规则要能回答「看到什么写什么」：给出触发条件、给出边界反例、给出与相邻标签的区分依据。UD 对每条 deprel 都规定 <code>Definition</code>、<code>Examples</code>、以及「它与哪些关系容易混淆」的对照段落（<a href=\"https://universaldependencies.org/u/dep/index.html\">u/dep/index.html</a>），这套「定义 + 正例 + 反例 + 易混对照」的四段式是被长期验证过的最小结构。</p>\n<p>规范写作有三条判据：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可判定性（decidability）</strong>：规则不能依赖标注者的语感。凡是需要「看情况」的地方，就说明还缺一条边界规则，应把它补成显式条件。</li>\n<li><strong>局部性（locality）</strong>：读者不必翻遍全文才能做一次判定。把一条规则需要的所有信息放在一页之内，跨节引用只用于定义术语。</li>\n<li><strong>反例完备</strong>：规范的强度由它覆盖的边界反例数量决定，而非正例数量。每轮试点暴露的新边界案例，都是规范该补的洞。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>规范不是文档，而是<strong>受版本控制的产物</strong>。改变已有判定结果的编辑是破坏性变更，必须 bump 版本并在 change history 里留痕——否则旧语料与新语料不可比，而数据格式校验看不出这一点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"迭代循环-试点-度量-补丁-冻结\">迭代循环：试点—度量—补丁—冻结</h2><p>规范从起草到冻结要经过若干轮<strong>试点标注（pilot）</strong>，每轮只标一小批（几百到一两千条），度量一致性，再把分歧回灌成规范补丁。收敛判据不是「一致率达到 0.8」，而是<strong>轮间增量收敛</strong>：当第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 轮的一致性相对第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 轮几乎不再提升时，说明剩下的分歧已不是规范缺陷，而是任务本身的真实变异。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.02</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_k = \\alpha_{k+1} - \\alpha_k &lt; \\epsilon \\quad (\\epsilon \\approx 0.02)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仍大且分集中，则说明规范还有洞，继续补。补丁不该「全面重写」，而应按<strong>分歧质量排序</strong>，优先修最贵的边界。设标签 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 在试点语料上的分歧质量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该标签被卷入的争议单元数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow></munder><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>labels</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>disagreement</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_l = \\sum_{u \\in U} \\mathbb{1}\\big[\\,l \\in \\text{labels}(u) \\;\\wedge\\; \\text{disagreement}(u)\\,\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">labels</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">disagreement</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每轮只改 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（通常 3–5 条）高频争议标签，改完立刻用同批语料复测，验证补丁是否真的把该标签的争议压下去。<strong>一次只动少数变量</strong>，否则无法归因。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[起草规范:&lt;br/&gt;定义+正例+反例+易混对照] --&gt; B[试点标注小批语料]&#10;    B --&gt; C[计算一致性并定位分歧]&#10;    C --&gt; D{轮间增量&lt;br/&gt;是否收敛}&#10;    D --&gt;|否: 仍有系统分歧| E[按分歧质量排序&lt;br/&gt;补 top-k 标签规则]&#10;    E --&gt; F[同批语料复测验证补丁]&#10;    F --&gt; C&#10;    D --&gt;|是| G[冻结规范&lt;br/&gt;bump 版本 + 记录 change history]&#10;    G --&gt; H[规模化标注 + 内嵌金标准监控]&#10;    H --&gt; I[长期漂移检测]&#10;    I --&gt;|发现新边界案例| E\">flowchart TD\n    A[起草规范:&lt;br/&gt;定义+正例+反例+易混对照] --&gt; B[试点标注小批语料]\n    B --&gt; C[计算一致性并定位分歧]\n    C --&gt; D{轮间增量&lt;br/&gt;是否收敛}\n    D --&gt;|否: 仍有系统分歧| E[按分歧质量排序&lt;br/&gt;补 top-k 标签规则]\n    E --&gt; F[同批语料复测验证补丁]\n    F --&gt; C\n    D --&gt;|是| G[冻结规范&lt;br/&gt;bump 版本 + 记录 change history]\n    G --&gt; H[规模化标注 + 内嵌金标准监控]\n    H --&gt; I[长期漂移检测]\n    I --&gt;|发现新边界案例| E</pre><p>冻结不等于停止迭代。规模化阶段仍会暴露新现象，正确做法是<strong>开一条受控的修订通道</strong>：收集边界案例、定期（如每月）批量评审，只在证据充分时 bump 小版本，并把新规则补进 change history。UD 的 guideline 变更表就是这个通道的公开形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标注者培训与资格认证\">标注者培训与资格认证</h2><p>培训的目标是让标注者对同一规则的<strong>推理路径</strong>一致，而不是背下规则表。有效流程分三步：先讲规则与反例，再用<strong>已裁决的样例句</strong>做练习，最后用一道与正式数据同分布、但答案已知的<strong>资格测试</strong>把不合格者挡在规模化之前。</p>\n<p>规模化阶段的两道防线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>失效信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资格测试</td>\n<td>上岗前</td>\n<td>筛掉无法达到一致性门槛的标注者</td>\n<td>通过率高但正式一致性低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内嵌金标准</td>\n<td>标注流中</td>\n<td>持续监控个体准确率与漂移</td>\n<td>金标准题准确率随时间下滑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定期校准轮</td>\n<td>周期</td>\n<td>全员重标同一样例、对齐理解</td>\n<td>校准轮一致性低于日常一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈回环</td>\n<td>每批后</td>\n<td>把个体系统性偏差反馈给本人</td>\n<td>修正后偏差不减</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>金标准（gold）要伪装在正常任务里</strong>，混入比例通常 5%–15%，标注者不知道哪条是金标准，否则会专门对付它。金标准题的来源是<strong>已仲裁的争议案例</strong>——它们恰是边界最需要稳定判定的地方，把仲裁结果固化成金标准，就把一次裁决变成长期的训练信号。</p>\n<p>校准轮是防漂移的关键。做法是让全体标注者重标同一小批已裁决样例句，比较本轮结果与金标准的偏离。若校准轮一致性明显低于日常一致性，说明日常标注里混进了「凭感觉但彼此不同」的判定，是规范需要补丁或培训需要重开的信号。<strong>同一个体若连续多轮在金标准上系统性偏向某一类，通常不是态度问题，而是他对某条规则的理解与规范不一致</strong>——反馈应指向具体规则，而非泛泛提醒。</p>\n<h2 id=\"仲裁-把分歧变成可复用的决定\">仲裁：把分歧变成可复用的决定</h2><p>只要有多人标注，就会有需要在某处收敛的分歧。仲裁（adjudication）流程设计要回答三件事：<strong>谁裁、裁什么、裁决结果存哪</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>谁裁</strong>取决于任务性质。事实性强的任务（句法依存、实体边界）收敛到单一金标准合理，由资深标注者或语言学专家裁决；主观性强的任务（质量评价、情感强度）不应强行收敛——保留多标注分布比单一裁决更有信息量。MQM（Multidimensional Quality Metrics）把翻译/生成质量拆成 Accuracy、Fluency、Terminology、Style 等维度并附严重度，评价者对严重度的判定天然分歧，其规范因此把「报告哪些维度、严重度如何定义」写成显式量表（<a href=\"https://themqm.org/\">themqm.org</a>），把主观性装进结构化槽位，而不是假装它不存在。</p>\n<p><strong>裁什么</strong>要有优先级，否则仲裁会淹没在低价值争议里。最常用的分流是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多数投票可解</strong>的（三人以上标注，多数一致）无需人工介入。</li>\n<li><strong>两人分歧且涉及高频标签</strong>的进人工仲裁队列。</li>\n<li><strong>两人分歧且涉及罕见标签</strong>的降级处理，先记录再批量评审。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>裁决结果存哪</strong>决定了流程能否复用。每一次仲裁都应产出三样东西：裁决后的标签、<strong>分歧本身的结构化记录</strong>、以及<strong>触发的规范疑问</strong>。分歧记录是发现规范缺陷最快的来源；把它整理成「案例 → 判定 → 依据规则」的对照表，下一轮培训可以直接复用。仲裁吞吐可用争议率刻画：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>adj</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>disputed</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>items</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{adj}} = \\frac{N_{\\text{disputed}}}{N_{\\text{items}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">items</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disputed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>adj</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{adj}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 长期偏高（经验上持续 &gt; 20%）通常指向规范缺陷而非标注者失职——该回到规范迭代循环补规则，而不是加大仲裁人力。相反，若某标签的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>adj</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{adj}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在几批之间突然抬升，多半是标注者对该标签的理解出现了群体性偏移，应立刻插入校准轮。</p>\n<p>仲裁的另一个职责是<strong>保护标注者的信号不被滥用</strong>。若流程把「与多数不一致」直接当成错误来惩罚，标注者会倾向于放弃正确但小众的判断、向多数靠拢，表面上一致性上升，实际上把真实变异抹平了。Plank 在 2022 年 EMNLP 的立场论文中指出，标注分歧常反映真实的人类变异、主观性或多个合理答案，一味消除会扭曲数据质量与模型评估（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.02570\">arXiv:2211.02570</a>）。因此仲裁应区分「规范可判定的误判」与「任务本身的合理分歧」：前者修正，后者保留。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流程度量-用什么指标管理这套循环\">流程度量：用什么指标管理这套循环</h2><p>管理流程要用能归因的指标，而非单一的一致性数字。候选集包括：每轮的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>（Krippendorff&#39;s alpha，支持多标注者与缺失值）、轮间增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、争议率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>adj</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{adj}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、金标准准确率的个体漂移、以及<strong>每标签的推翻率</strong>（仲裁推翻初判的比例）。前三个管规范迭代节奏，后两个管人与漂移。把一致性当作唯一 KPI 会诱发「为达标而合并标签」的刷分行为，把本该区分的类压平——这正是规范质量下降的典型征兆。</p>\n<p>这套流程与本 hub 的 <a href=\"annotation-scheme-label-design\">标注体系与标签集设计建模</a> 互补：那一篇管「标签集与 schema 怎么设计」，本篇管「设计好之后靠什么流程把它稳定地执行下去」。规范定结构，流程保一致——缺任何一层，语料都会在规模化阶段失去可比性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>规范是受版本控制的<strong>判定程序</strong>，一条规则用「定义 + 正例 + 反例 + 易混对照」四段式写，判据是可判定性、局部性与反例完备。</li>\n<li>迭代靠试点循环：每轮只补 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 高频争议标签并用同批语料复测；收敛判据是轮间增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_k &lt; \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>，而不是某个绝对一致性阈值。</li>\n<li>培训分三步——讲规则、练已裁决例句、上资格测试；规模化靠内嵌金标准（5%–15%、来源是仲裁案例）与定期校准轮防漂移。</li>\n<li>仲裁要答清谁裁、裁什么、存哪；事实性任务收敛金标准，主观性任务保留多标注分布；裁决结果须连同分歧与触发的规范疑问一起归档。</li>\n<li>争议率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>adj</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{adj}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 长期偏高指向规范缺陷而非标注者失职；把「与多数不一致」当惩罚会抹平真实变异，反而污染数据。</li>\n<li>管理指标要有能归因的组合（alpha、增量、争议率、金标准漂移、推翻率），单一一致性 KPI 会诱发合并标签的刷分行为。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"标注规范迭代、培训与仲裁流程","id":"标注规范迭代-培训与仲裁流程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：规范是可执行的判定程序","id":"核心概念-规范是可执行的判定程序"},{"level":2,"text":"迭代循环：试点—度量—补丁—冻结","id":"迭代循环-试点-度量-补丁-冻结"},{"level":2,"text":"标注者培训与资格认证","id":"标注者培训与资格认证"},{"level":2,"text":"仲裁：把分歧变成可复用的决定","id":"仲裁-把分歧变成可复用的决定"},{"level":2,"text":"流程度量：用什么指标管理这套循环","id":"流程度量-用什么指标管理这套循环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"标注体系与标签集设计建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/corpus-linguistics-language-resource-engineering/annotation-schema-agreement/annotation-scheme-label-design"},"next":{"title":"一致性系数计算与标注质量门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/corpus-linguistics-language-resource-engineering/annotation-schema-agreement/agreement-metrics-quality-control"}}